#6421
In the Shadow of the Flying Mountain~
Incredibly, above you, suspended in mid-air, is a huge mountain. You
bob in the shallow waters shaded by the flying mountain. You crane your
neck upward and see high above you massive chains and winches which
support many pirate ships beneath the flying mountain. Also, high above
you, you can make out a rope ladder. Sadly the ladder, too, has been 
wound most of the way up, and is far out of your reach. Your boat bumps
a buoy.
~
